      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Hissss!!",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Hello there to you too!",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Who... enters... my domain?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Captain Blackball and his right-hand man of course, did you not know we were coming? The blue thing said he'd tell you.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "I know what you seek.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Oh do you? Great! Well, shall we just play pool for it and we'll see if it's any good?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "You can't just 'play pool' for a hat. It's a legendary hat, I'm not exactly going to just GIVE IT AWAY after some stupid game, am I?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Hat?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "You have come here for the legendary hat, no?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "No I'm here for the golden cue. What does the hat do?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Not telling you.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Good thing I didn't really want it then, isn't it! So, the mysterious artifact of legend, the mystical, the marvellous, the wonderful, the dazzling, the coveted... golden cue?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Yeah I've got that. But I'm not exactly going to just GIVE IT AWAY after some stupid game, am I?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Isn't that how you won it in the first place?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Well yeah, but...",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "No buts! Come on now, let's play fair.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "The only thing fair round here is the fiery chasm in which I dwell. Its flames will absorb you, charring your flesh, peeling away like a... potato.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "No, we've done the potato stuff last chapter. Do flames even absorb?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Consume then.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Fitting.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Remember what'll happen if you lose? Everything is at stake in this perilous ritual of the spheres.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Even the hat?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Except the hat, Blackball. Just the golden cue which you desire so much, for some reason.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Yes please, so let's have it, game of pool?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "And if you lose?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "I'm not playing. My friend here is.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "If your friend loses, they will die. Simple as that.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Do I still get the cue?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Yeah I reckon.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Blackball",
          "text": "Great! Pool, then?",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "*nods*",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lucy",
          "text": "Let us begin the ritual of the spheres. Your friend will die.",
          "stage": {
            "background": "hell",
            "characters": [
              "blackball",
              "lucy_fir"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
